{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"teacher-forcing-training","content_sha256":"sha256:946d4d8ac409c1b8d605043796a45f65862e36674f03122d16f25a4688636a92","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789959334.1750872,"domain":"model-architecture","explanation":"teacher forcing 用 ground-truth 作为每步条件,配合因果掩码可一次性并行算全序列损失;但会带来训练/推理的暴露偏差(exposure bias)。","id":"q-arch-mag6-teacher-forcing-010","options":[{"id":"a","text":"训练时把真实的目标序列(而非模型自己上一步的预测)作为下一步输入,使各位置可并行计算损失、训练更稳定"},{"id":"b","text":"训练时始终用模型自己的预测作为输入,导致误差累积"},{"id":"c","text":"它是一种在推理阶段用来加速的缓存技术"},{"id":"d","text":"它指用更大的 teacher 模型蒸馏 student"}],"prompt":"训练自回归语言模型时的‘teacher forcing’指的是什么?","review_state":null,"rubric":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"mechanism","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"Attention Is All You Need","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"training-objective","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
